message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: "Algebraic curves from first prime-race crossings"
abstract: "The first hitting heights on two prime-ideal races generate explicit multiquadratic function fields. Three targets realize every real algebraic elliptic j-invariant at least 1728. Rational target triples give independent points on V^2 = U^3 - U. At most one cross-field pair admits a power relation modulo algebraic numbers."
